# Copy to server/.env (and/or server/.dev.vars) for local wrangler.
# Never commit the real file. Wrangler reads .dev.vars; `npm run dev`
# copies .env → .dev.vars when .dev.vars is missing.
#
# uma.moe API key (X-API-Key) for /api/v4/circles and /parent lookup:
key=
# Optional: anonymous X-Browser-Proof from uma.moe (Partner ID shares).
# API keys always set will_persist=true and can return a saved trainer parent
# instead of the practice share. Proofs expire ~5 minutes.
# UMA_BROWSER_PROOF=
